<title>SPAIN: Spanish building sector activity fell 3.7% in Q1.</title>
<headline>Spanish building sector activity fell 3.7% in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish building activity fell in the first quarter of 1997 by 3.7 percent from the same period a year ago, but it is likely to pick up in the second half of the year, a study by Caja de Catalunya said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;In the first quarter of 1997 building activity in Spain revealed a better trend, despite the actual decline,&quot; the study reported. It added that economic indicators for the industry are pointing toward a pick up in activity in the coming months.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
